# eci Provider

The ECI provider allows you to manage [Elice Cloud Infrastructure](https://elice.cloud) resources using Terraform.

## Resource Architecture

ECI resources have the following relationship:

```
eci_virtual_machine          (VM spec: name, instance type, pricing)
├── eci_block_storage        (disk: boot disk, data disk)
├── eci_virtual_network      (network: CIDR, firewall rules)
│   └── eci_subnet           (subnet: gateway, purpose)
│       └── eci_network_interface  (NIC: attached to VM and subnet)
│           └── eci_public_ip      (public IP: attached to NIC)
└── eci_virtual_machine_allocation (execution: starts/stops the VM)
```

- `eci_virtual_machine` defines the VM spec but does **not** start it.
- `eci_virtual_machine_allocation` starts the VM. Removing it stops the VM without deleting it.

